---
// src/components/WhyChooseUs.astro
---
<section class="py-24 bg-white border-b border-brand-100">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-brand-950 mb-4 tracking-tight">Why Choose Bagasse Tableware?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-brand-800 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-medium">Enterprise-grade sustainability without compromising on durability, performance, or logistics.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-8 bg-brand-50 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 text-center group">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-full text-brand-600 mb-6 shadow-sm group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-brand-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-950 text-lg mb-2">100% Biodegradable</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-800 leading-relaxed">Naturally composts within 60-90 days, leaving zero toxic residue in the environment.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-8 bg-brand-50 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 text-center group">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-full text-brand-600 mb-6 shadow-sm group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-brand-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 18.657A8 8 0 016.343 7.343S7 9 9 10c0-2 .5-5 2.986-7C14 5 16.09 5.777 17.656 7.343A7.975 7.975 0 0120 13a7.975 7.975 0 01-2.343 5.657z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-950 text-lg mb-2">Microwave & Freeze Safe</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-800 leading-relaxed">Engineered to handle extreme temperatures without losing structural integrity or leaking.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-8 bg-brand-50 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 text-center group">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-full text-brand-600 mb-6 shadow-sm group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-brand-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-950 text-lg mb-2">PFAS & Toxin Free</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-800 leading-relaxed">Strictly manufactured without forever chemicals, plastic liners, or harmful bleaching agents.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-8 bg-brand-50 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 text-center group">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-full text-brand-600 mb-6 shadow-sm group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-brand-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-950 text-lg mb-2">Export Certified</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-800 leading-relaxed">Fully compliant with international customs and global food safety standards for seamless logistics.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>